{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人連敬涵於節目中推介農夫山泉(9633)，一來業務結構轉型成功，茶飲成第一收入來源，茶飲旗下新品牌亦打開增量空間，相信品牌與渠道優勢支撐長期增長。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ygv0FoHiOx1792048564.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>連敬涵建議40.5元才買入，目標價上望45元，若失守38元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>農夫山泉(9633)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$40.5</p><p>目標：$45</p><p>止蝕：$38</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PkL5SQwfRr1792048705.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>股評人趙晞文推介百勝中國(9987)，一來預期業績穩健，目前估值也吸引，另外環顧其他內需及飲食股，企業在財務及管理層也很穩定，認為股價向上的值博空間不少。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QBinWIHjUW1792048718.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>趙晞文建議335元買入，目標價看388元，止蝕價在290元。</p><p></p><p>百勝中國(9987)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$335</p><p>目標：$388</p><p>止蝕：$290</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Wf8IAgNBEL1792048736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:03:05.315334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:48.196808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:15.888627+00:00","content_hash":"8cfb3c5f85642162e4cf59246f358cbdbb55747833e6601bd6b418d9674b6de2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}